---
module: backend
func_id: checkins
---

***conformance tests***

# store-checkin
After a reset, `POST /api/checkins` for patient "p9" with wellbeing 7 and pain 3 answers 200 with an integer `checkinId`.

# same-day-replaces
After a reset, two check-ins of patient "p9" on the same day answer with the same `checkinId`.

***acceptance tests***

# unknown-patient
A check-in for patient "nobody" answers 404.

# rating-out-of-range
A check-in for patient "p9" with wellbeing 11 answers 422.
